  "app": "raven",
  "key": "## Channels\n\nRaven helps you and your team communicate with each other.\n\nConversation happen in **channels**. \n\nAll users who have access to Raven can view and send messages in **Open** channels. \n\n**Public** channels are visible to everyone, but only members can take send messages in them. Any user can join public channels. \n\n**Private** channels are only visible to members and new members can only be added by the channel admin - which is the creator of the channel. \n\nYou could also send messages to other users privately via **Direct messages** - including yourself!\n\nA user could create as many channels and add as many users as they want to in them. ",
  "refs": [
   "raven/raven/raven/onboarding_step/introduction_to_raven/introduction_to_raven.json"
  ],
  "translation": "## 频道\n\nRaven 帮助您与团队成员相互沟通。\n\n交流在**频道**中进行。\n\n所有可访问 Raven 的用户都可以在**开放**频道中查看和发送消息。\n\n**公开**频道对所有人可见，但只有成员才能在其中发送消息。任何用户都可以加入公开频道。\n\n**私有**频道仅对成员可见，新成员只能由频道管理员（即频道创建者）添加。\n\n您还可以通过**私信**与其他用户私下交流，甚至可以发给自己！\n\n每个用户都可以创建任意多个频道，并在其中添加任意多个用户。",
